{"parentUuid":"ea5fc34c-7dca-49ec-a8e0-6ce2a9d32173","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e7d537ee-a6e7-4f20-967c-01064d742f22","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015UckLxZR8Juzcs816SxSue","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"productized service definition origin Brian Casel \"productize\" recurring\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Productize & Scale – Launch and grow a productized service business.\",\"url\":\"https://www.productizeandscale.com/\"},{\"title\":\"The Business of Freelancing, Episode 21: Brian Casel on Productized Services - Double Your Freelancing\",\"url\":\"https://doubleyourfreelancing.com/productizedservices/\"},{\"title\":\"Productize Launch Recap & Case Study | Brian Casel\",\"url\":\"https://briancasel.com/case-study-recap-productize-course-launch\"},{\"title\":\"Episode 208 | How To Productize Your Service with Brian Casel\",\"url\":\"https://www.startupsfortherestofus.com/episodes/episode-208-how-to-productize-your-service-with-brian-casel\"},{\"title\":\"What is a Productized Service? - Smartpedia - t2informatik\",\"url\":\"https://t2informatik.de/en/smartpedia/productized-service/\"},{\"title\":\"Brian Casel – Productize 2020 - WSOZONE\",\"url\":\"https://wsozone.com/product/brian-casel-productize-2020/\"},{\"title\":\"Lifestyle Business Series: Productized Service 101 w/ Brian Casel - Zero to Travel\",\"url\":\"https://zerototravel.com/productized-service/\"},{\"title\":\"Brian Casel Explains Why Productised Services Rule -\",\"url\":\"https://www.agencymavericks.com/brian-casel-productised-services/\"},{\"title\":\"Master Class: How to productize your service - with Brian Casel - Business Podcast for Startups\",\"url\":\"https://mixergy.com/course-cheat-sheet-productize-your-service/\"},{\"title\":\"Earning $10k+ Per Month With A Productized Service (And Only 2 Hours Of Work) | With Brian Casel - 6figurecreative.com\",\"url\":\"https://6figurecreative.com/earning-10k-per-month-with-a-productized-service-and-only-2-hours-of-work-with-brian-casel/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about productized services, their definition, origins, and Brian Casel's role:\n\n## Definition\n\nA productized service is a standardized, outcome-focused service offered and sold like a product, with fixed scope, pricing, and delivery. At its core, productized services are about making things more predictable—more predictable projects and more predictable revenue (often recurring revenue).\n\n## Brian Casel's Role in Popularizing the Concept\n\nThe idea was popularised by entrepreneurs such as Brian Casel and Dan Norris. They recognised that standardisation not only creates efficiency, but also builds trust.\n\nCasel came to this model through his own experience. Brian realised a service-based business was not conducive to the life he wanted. He believed that products might be the answer. However, SaaS products take a long time to generate sustainable revenue, and he didn't want to waste any more time. Which is where productised services came into play. He realised he could take a service that he was already offering, and then market and price it like a product.\n\n## Key Characteristics\n\nFrom the customer's perspective, they're essentially paying you to do a particular job; but you are in some ways decoupling the hours worked from the service itself. So, you're no longer billing by the hour; you're billing for the project itself. The idea involves selling something that companies need on a repeated recurring basis and then building a process and team.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"dec36da7-eaa7-4b60-9c4d-b7cb9a667c04","timestamp":"2026-06-24T02:37:47.472Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"productized service definition origin Brian Casel \"productize\" recurring","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01SM1HfstvSj2DPbp1DY7qLs","content":[{"title":"Productize & Scale – L